	<text xml:lang="la">
		<body>
			<div xml:id="div1" corresp="regest1">
				<p>
					<s n="1" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z1"/>S.</s>
					<s n="2" xml:lang="la">En tibi, mi venerande pariter et plusquam charissime <persName ref="p495">Bullingere</persName>, <lb xml:id="p1z2"/>optimum nostrum <persName ref="p8354">Lętum</persName><note xml:id="fn1" type="footnote" n="1">Zum Besuch <persName ref="p8354">Georg Frölichs</persName> am 25. September in <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> s. oben <ref target="file12250">Nr. 2203</ref>, Anm. 20.</note>, virum solide pium nec vulgariter eruditum, <lb xml:id="p1z3"/>quique multo rerum usu (quippe in amplissimis rebuspublicis <lb xml:id="p1z4"/>diu versatus) magnam prudentiam collegit.</s>
					<s n="3" xml:lang="la">Nihil dicam <lb xml:id="p1z5"/>de candidissimis moribus et rara quadam viri humanitate<note xml:id="fna" type="footnote" n="a">humanitate <hi>am Rande nachgetragen.</hi></note>, qua mox se <lb xml:id="p1z6"/>vel unius horulę<note xml:id="fn2" type="footnote" n="2">Horula: Stündlein; s. <bibl source="b316">Hoven</bibl> s.v.</note> congressu mire se ac suavissime bonorum animis <lb xml:id="p1z7"/>insinuat.</s>
					<s n="4" xml:lang="la">Tenuit illum iam diu impatiens valde de<lb xml:id="p1z8"/>siderium tui videndi ac se tecum oblectandi in domino.</s>
					<s n="5" xml:lang="la">Proinde <lb xml:id="p1z9"/>non tam filioli sui<note xml:id="fn3" type="footnote" ana="bio" n="3">Wohl der älteste Sohn <persName ref="p20383">Jonas</persName>, der <hi>1551/52 in</hi> <placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName> immatrikuliert wurde (<placeName ref="l28">Basel</placeName>, Matrikel 1174, Nr. 45). -Zu <persName ref="p8354">Frölichs</persName> Kindern s. oben <ref target="file12242">Nr. 2195</ref>, Anm. 8.</note> caussa, qui hic apud hunc charissimum meum <lb xml:id="p1z10"/><persName ref="p4868">Funcklium</persName><note xml:id="fn4" type="footnote" n="4"><persName ref="p4868">Jakob Funcklin</persName>, zu dieser Zeit u.a. Privatlehrerin <placeName ref="l257">Konstanzer</placeName> s. oben <ref target="file12282">Nr. 2235</ref>, Anm. f. - Siehe auch dessen Brief an <persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> aus <placeName ref="l587">Zürich</placeName> vom 26. September (<persName ref="p8055">Blarer</persName> BW II 392, <ref target="file11264">Nr. 1221</ref>).</note> educatur, quam ut hinc postea ad vos proficisceretur, <lb xml:id="p1z11"/>iter hoc ingressum se affirmat.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div2" corresp="regest2">
				<p>
					<s n="6" xml:lang="la">Comendarem tibi tam quam <lb xml:id="p1z12"/>animam meam utrumque<note xml:id="fn5" type="footnote" n="5"><persName ref="p8354">Frölich</persName> und <persName ref="p4868">Funcklin</persName>.</note>, ni toties expertus scirem tuam erga <lb xml:id="p1z13"/>amicos, vestrorumque omnium erga id genus viros officiosam h<lb xml:id="p1z14"/>umanitatem et humanissimam officiositatem.</s>
					<s n="7" xml:lang="la">Voluit autem <persName ref="p8354">Lętus</persName> <lb xml:id="p1z15"/>hic noster, ut <persName ref="p4868">Funcklius</persName>, vere sanctus iuvenis mihique <lb xml:id="p1z16"/>magis quam filius charus, ecclesię nostrę insignis minister, se sibi <lb xml:id="p1z17"/>itineris comitem adiungeret, id quod ille facere haud grava<lb xml:id="p1z18"/>tim consensit.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div3" corresp="regest3">
				<p>
					<s n="8" xml:lang="la">Fruere igitur illis in domino tibique persuade <lb xml:id="p1z19"/>dei viros (quod vere sunt) tua tecta non absque magnarum <lb xml:id="p1z20"/>felicitatum comitatu subire.</s>
					<s n="9" xml:lang="la">Porro non est, ut quicquam nunc <lb xml:id="p1z21"/>iis addam, quoniam ii mihi apud te vivarum epistolarum vice erunt <lb xml:id="p1z22"/>de omnibus nostris rebus bona te fide facturi certiorem.<pb type="edition" next="547"/></s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div4" corresp="regest4">
				<p>
					<s n="10" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell"><lb xml:id="p1z23"/>Bene vale, mi anime, colendissime in Christo frater, et sancta <lb xml:id="p1z24"/>lętitia cum <persName ref="p8354">Lęto</persName> nostro feliciter lętare.</s>
					<s n="11" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Saluta tuam domum <lb xml:id="p1z25"/>cum omnibus fratribus et amicis.</s>
					<s n="12" xml:lang="la" ana="salute">Salvere te plurimum iubent <lb xml:id="p1z26"/>seque piis precationibus tuis commendant nostri, praecipue germanus <lb xml:id="p1z27"/>meus <persName ref="p8178">frater</persName><note xml:id="fn6" type="footnote" n="6"><persName ref="p8178">Thomas Blarer</persName>.</note> et <persName ref="p4082">Zviccius</persName><note xml:id="fn7" type="footnote" n="7"><persName ref="p4082">Konrad Zwick</persName>.</note>.</s>
					<s n="13" xml:lang="la" ana="farewell">Iterum vale.</s>
					<s n="14" xml:lang="la"><placeName ref="l257">Constantiae</placeName>, 24. septembris 1545.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<s n="15" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z28"/>Tuus <persName ref="p8055">Ambros. Blaurerus</persName>.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
			<div xml:id="div5" corresp="regest5">
				<p>
					<s n="16" xml:lang="la"><lb xml:id="p1z29"/>Existimo eas te literas<note xml:id="fn8" type="footnote" n="8">Wohl oben <ref target="file12296">Nr. 2249</ref>.</note> accepisse, <lb xml:id="p1z30"/>quas diebus hisce per adulescentem <lb xml:id="p1z31"/><persName ref="p20172">Ioannem ab Ulmis</persName><note xml:id="fn9" type="footnote" n="9"><persName ref="p20172">Johannes von Ulm</persName>.</note> tibi curavi reddendas.</s>
				</p>
				<p>
					<note type="address">[Adresse auf der Rückseite:]</note>
					<s n="17" xml:lang="la">C<pb/><lb xml:id="p2z1"/>larissimo viro dei <lb xml:id="p2z2"/>d. <persName ref="p495">Heinricho Bullingero</persName>, <lb xml:id="p2z3"/>venerando suo et charissimo fratri.</s>
				</p>
			</div>
		</body>
	</text>
